stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> extract_info

    extract_info --> extract_info: needs more info
    extract_info --> generate_question: stage == "generate_question"
    extract_info --> retrieve_context: stage == "retrieve_context"
    extract_info --> [*]: stage == "wait_for_user" or "complete"
    
    generate_question --> extract_info: returns to extract info
    generate_question --> generate_question: needs refinement
    generate_question --> [*]: stage == "wait_for_user" or "end"
    
    retrieve_context --> retrieve_context: processing context
    retrieve_context --> generate_rule: stage == "generate_rule"
    retrieve_context --> [*]: stage == "end"
    
    generate_rule --> [*]: always ends after rule generation

    note right of extract_info
        Extracts service information from user messages
        Determines if enough info is gathered
        Progress to rule generation after 30 rounds
    end note

    note right of generate_question
        Generates follow-up questions based on 
        missing information in current state
    end note

    note right of retrieve_context
        Gets context from AWS dependencies, 
        service type, and framework
    end note

    note right of generate_rule
        Creates PrometheusRule YAML 
        based on service info and examples
    end note